{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As the team's operator, build and maintain your team to fight against hostiles escalating in difficulty.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4118030/extras/3a9a07606354dcb62e1aa7623f606e86.poster.avif?t=1773706054\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4118030/extras/3a9a07606354dcb62e1aa7623f606e86.webm?t=1773706054\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4118030/extras/3a9a07606354dcb62e1aa7623f606e86.mp4?t=1773706054\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pick from a random selection of characters, abilities, mods, and upgrade chips.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Characters have unique stats and classes, Attackers, Defenders, and Support.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Team abilities, triggered automatically by characters.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Operator abilities, triggered manually by selecting characters or enemies.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mods, increases stats by rarity and triggers elemental effects.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upgrade chips, increases stats and can stack continually.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4118030/extras/edb976e46982682b8d160298aa8dc065.poster.avif?t=1773706054\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4118030/extras/edb976e46982682b8d160298aa8dc065.webm?t=1773706054\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4118030/extras/edb976e46982682b8d160298aa8dc065.mp4?t=1773706054\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Defeat the boss on round 20 to complete the run and raise the heat level cap.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Heat level increases the difficulty and can increase infinitely.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether the run is a success or failure, earn experience to upgrade your team or unlock special traits to enhance your future runs.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Complete a checklist of goals during the run to earn additional experience.</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4118030?t=1773706054","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4118030?t=1773706054","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4118030/b2444bbf445727bc8954b046d552433caef4338a/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1773706054","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4118030/b2444bbf445727bc8954b046d552433caef4338a/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1773706054","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":4267410,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As the team's operator, build and maintain your team to fight against hostiles escalating in difficulty.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"htt